  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile settings, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (e.g., config_039) achieve high validation accuracy (0.724989). This experiment tests whether using pca_n2000 RNA encoder with imagenet_vit_l image encoder (instead of scvi_n200) in the same setup can maintain or improve performance, clarifying the impact of RNA encoder choice on accuracy. It balances exploitation of proven components (transformer + weighted fusion) with exploration of RNA encoder alternatives."
